  "summary": "Costa Coffee (located at Next, The Plaza, Oxford St) is a highly standardized, multinational counter-service coffee chain. Evaluated under the Culinary Anthropologist framework, it represents the exact antithesis of an authentic culinary destination. It fails the 'Establishment Integrity' requirement as it is a cafe/bakery and not a full-service sit-down restaurant, leading to an automatic disqualification.",
